OVERVIEW: Display information about a JPIP server or DICOM file

Shows JPIP transfer syntax information for a DICOM file, or queries
server statistics when given a server URL.

Examples:
  dicom-jpip info study.dcm
  dicom-jpip info http://pacs.example.com:8080
  dicom-jpip info --list-syntaxes

USAGE: dicom-jpip info [<target>] [--list-syntaxes] [--json]

ARGUMENTS:
  <target>                DICOM file path or JPIP server URL (optional)

OPTIONS:
  --list-syntaxes         List JPIP transfer syntaxes
  --json                  Output as JSON
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

